{"id":"3b4717c53a5d62fd","bookSlug":"robot-textbook","relPath":"section_7/section_7.md","title":"第7章 轮腿复合运动控制","sections":["正文"],"excerpt":"在轮式模式下，机器人依靠两个轮毂电机独立驱动，通过差速实现直线前进和原地转向。设左右轮线速度分别为 $vL$ 和 $vR$，两轮间距为 $d$（本平台 $d = 280$ mm），则机器人质心处的前进速度 $v$ 和转向角速度 $\\omega$ 为：","order":8,"previousId":"c4d47cb6a6f4ed45","nextId":"6f025302c26e487b","html":"<h1 id=\"7\">第7章 轮腿复合运动控制</h1>\n<h2 id=\"71\">7.1 轮式模式速度与转向控制</h2>\n<h3 id=\"711\">7.1.1 差速驱动模型</h3>\n<p>在轮式模式下，机器人依靠两个轮毂电机独立驱动，通过差速实现直线前进和原地转向。设左右轮线速度分别为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v_L</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v_L</script></span> 和 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v_R</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v_R</script></span>，两轮间距为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">d</span><script type=\"math/tex\">d</script></span>（本平台 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">d = 280</span><script type=\"math/tex\">d = 280</script></span> mm），则机器人质心处的前进速度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v</script></span> 和转向角速度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\omega</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\omega</script></span> 为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nv = \\frac{v_L + v_R}{2}\n$$\n$$\n\\omega = \\frac{v_R - v_L}{d}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nv = \\frac{v_L + v_R}{2}\n$$\n$$\n\\omega = \\frac{v_R - v_L}{d}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>由期望速度指令 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v_{ref}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v_{ref}</script></span> 和 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\omega_{ref}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\omega_{ref}</script></span>，解算左右轮目标速度：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nv_L^{ref} = v_{ref} - \\frac{d}{2}\\omega_{ref}\n$$\n$$\nv_R^{ref} = v_{ref} + \\frac{d}{2}\\omega_{ref}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nv_L^{ref} = v_{ref} - \\frac{d}{2}\\omega_{ref}\n$$\n$$\nv_R^{ref} = v_{ref} + \\frac{d}{2}\\omega_{ref}\n</script>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"712\">7.1.2 轮速控制</h3>\n<p>每个轮毂电机采用速度环PI控制器，内环为电流环。速度环周期1 kHz，输出为电流参考值。速度反馈由轮毂电机编码器差分获得。</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">// 轮速控制（1kHz调用）</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">wheel_speed_control</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 左轮速度环</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error_L</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_L</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_ref</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_L</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_fb</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_L</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">iq_ref</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pi_update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">wheel_L</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_pi</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error_L</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 右轮速度环</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error_R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_ref</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_fb</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">iq_ref</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pi_update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">wheel_R</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">speed_pi</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error_R</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 电流环已在50us中断中执行</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>PI参数初始值：<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p = 0.8,\\ K_i = 0.05</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p = 0.8,\\ K_i = 0.05</script></span>，输出限幅 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\pm 3</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\pm 3</script></span> A。</p>\n<h3 id=\"713\">7.1.3 转向控制</h3>\n<p>上层导航模块输出 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v_{ref}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v_{ref}</script></span> 和 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\omega_{ref}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\omega_{ref}</script></span>，底层直接进行差速解算。对于原地旋转（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">v=0, \\omega\\neq 0</span><script type=\"math/tex\">v=0, \\omega\\neq 0</script></span>），左右轮速度方向相反，需注意轮子打滑和身体扭动。可通过调节身体高度或增加腿部阻尼改善。</p>\n<h2 id=\"72\">7.2 腿式步态规划与足端轨迹</h2>\n<h3 id=\"721\">7.2.1 步态序列设计</h3>\n<p>腿式模式用于越障、爬坡和复杂地形。采用准静态步态，保证任意时刻至少有一个支撑点，重心投影始终位于支撑多边形内。基本步态序列为：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>初始站立</strong>：双腿支撑，轮子锁死。</li>\n<li><strong>抬左腿</strong>：左腿轮子离地，右腿支撑。</li>\n<li><strong>左腿前伸</strong>：左腿摆动至目标位置。</li>\n<li><strong>左腿落地</strong>：恢复双腿支撑。</li>\n<li><strong>抬右腿</strong>：右腿轮子离地，左腿支撑。</li>\n<li><strong>右腿前伸</strong>：右腿摆动至目标位置。</li>\n<li><strong>右腿落地</strong>：恢复双腿支撑，完成一个步态周期。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"722\">7.2.2 足端轨迹规划</h3>\n<p>摆动腿的轮心轨迹采用摆线或五次多项式，保证起始和终止时刻速度、加速度为零，减少冲击。</p>\n<p>设摆动周期为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">T_s = 0.6</span><script type=\"math/tex\">T_s = 0.6</script></span> s，步长 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">L_s = 100</span><script type=\"math/tex\">L_s = 100</script></span> mm，抬腿高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">H_s = 60</span><script type=\"math/tex\">H_s = 60</script></span> mm。以髋关节为参考，足端在矢状面内的轨迹为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nx(t) = x_0 + \\frac{L_s}{T_s} t - \\frac{L_s}{2\\pi} \\sin\\left( \\frac{2\\pi t}{T_s} \\right)\n$$\n$$\nz(t) = z_0 - \\frac{H_s}{2} \\left[ 1 - \\cos\\left( \\frac{2\\pi t}{T_s} \\right) \\right]\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nx(t) = x_0 + \\frac{L_s}{T_s} t - \\frac{L_s}{2\\pi} \\sin\\left( \\frac{2\\pi t}{T_s} \\right)\n$$\n$$\nz(t) = z_0 - \\frac{H_s}{2} \\left[ 1 - \\cos\\left( \\frac{2\\pi t}{T_s} \\right) \\right]\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">(x_0, z_0)</span><script type=\"math/tex\">(x_0, z_0)</script></span> 为摆动开始时刻的足端坐标。通过逆运动学将足端轨迹映射为髋、膝关节角轨迹。</p>\n<h3 id=\"723\">7.2.3 步态规划代码实现</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">// 摆线足端轨迹生成</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">swing_trajectory</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">                      </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">2.0f</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M_PI</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">L_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">M_PI</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sinf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">H_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cosf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">// 步态循环（简化）</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">leg_gait_cycle</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">// 0:左腿摆动, 1:右腿摆动</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.6</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H_s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.06</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// 左腿摆动</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">swing_trajectory</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">L_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">H_s</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">left_swing_x0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">left_swing_z0</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// 逆运动学求解左腿关节角</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">inverse_kinematics</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">z</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">leg_L</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">q_hip_L_ref</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">q_knee_L_ref</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"c1\">// 设置关节角度目标</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">joint_L_hip</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">target_angle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_hip_L_ref</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">joint_L_knee</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">target_angle</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">q_knee_L_ref</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.001</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">// 1kHz</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T_s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">phase</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// 右腿摆动，类似</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// ...</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h2 id=\"73\">7.3 轮腿协同控制策略</h2>\n<h3 id=\"731\">7.3.1 模式切换状态机</h3>\n<p>机器人工作模式由上层决策，底层执行切换。状态机如下：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code>        ┌──────────────┐\n        │   待机模式    │\n        └──────┬───────┘\n               │ 使能\n        ┌──────▼───────┐\n        │   轮式模式    │◄──────┐\n        └──────┬───────┘       │\n               │ 检测障碍/台阶   │\n        ┌──────▼───────┐       │\n        │   腿式模式    │───────┘\n        └──────┬───────┘\n               │ 任务完成\n        ┌──────▼───────┐\n        │   返回轮式    │\n        └──────────────┘\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>切换条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>轮式 → 腿式：检测到障碍物高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">&gt; 30</span><script type=\"math/tex\">> 30</script></span> mm（超声波或深度相机），且速度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">&lt; 0.5</span><script type=\"math/tex\">< 0.5</script></span> m/s。</li>\n<li>腿式 → 轮式：越障完成，身体姿态恢复水平，轮地接触确认。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"732\">7.3.2 协同控制</h3>\n<p>在轮式模式下，腿部关节并非完全锁死，而是采用<strong>阻抗控制</strong>，提供可调阻尼和刚度，适应地面不平并减少振动。关节力矩输出为：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\tau_j = K_p (q_j^{ref} - q_j) + K_d (\\dot{q}_j^{ref} - \\dot{q}_j)\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\tau_j = K_p (q_j^{ref} - q_j) + K_d (\\dot{q}_j^{ref} - \\dot{q}_j)\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span> 和 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_d</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_d</script></span> 为阻抗参数。在平坦路面使用高刚度保持姿态，在颠簸路面降低刚度以吸收冲击。</p>\n<p>轮腿协同的典型场景：通过低矮障碍（如减速带）时，轮子持续驱动，同时膝关节主动收缩，提高轮子离地间隙，避免碰撞；通过后恢复伸展。</p>\n<h2 id=\"74\">7.4 姿态控制与平衡</h2>\n<h3 id=\"741\">7.4.1 简化倒立摆模型</h3>\n<p>双足轮腿机器人的平衡问题可简化为二维倒立摆。设质心高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">h_c</span><script type=\"math/tex\">h_c</script></span>，俯仰角 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta</script></span>，轮子提供水平驱动力 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F</script></span> 和力矩 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\tau_w</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\tau_w</script></span>。线性化动力学（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\theta</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\theta</script></span> 小角度）：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\ddot{\\theta} = \\frac{M g h_c}{I_c} \\theta - \\frac{h_c}{I_c} F\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\ddot{\\theta} = \\frac{M g h_c}{I_c} \\theta - \\frac{h_c}{I_c} F\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">M</span><script type=\"math/tex\">M</script></span> 为等效质量，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">I_c</span><script type=\"math/tex\">I_c</script></span> 为质心绕轮轴的转动惯量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"742-lqr\">7.4.2 LQR平衡控制器</h3>\n<p>选择状态向量 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mathbf{x} = [x, \\dot{x}, \\theta, \\dot{\\theta}]^T</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mathbf{x} = [x, \\dot{x}, \\theta, \\dot{\\theta}]^T</script></span>，控制输入 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">u = F</span><script type=\"math/tex\">u = F</script></span>。离散化后设计LQR控制器：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\nu = -\\mathbf{K} \\mathbf{x}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\nu = -\\mathbf{K} \\mathbf{x}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>通过离线求解Riccati方程获得反馈增益 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\mathbf{K}</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\mathbf{K}</script></span>。在MCU中实现为状态反馈：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"c1\">// LQR平衡控制（1kHz）</span>\n<span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">lqr_balance_control</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x_dot</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theta</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">theta_dot</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">x_dot</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">theta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">K</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">theta_dot</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 限幅</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F_MAX</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">F_MAX</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">F_MAX</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">F_MAX</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K</script></span> 的典型值（本平台参数）为 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">[ -0.15, -0.32, 12.8, 2.1 ]</span><script type=\"math/tex\">[ -0.15, -0.32, 12.8, 2.1 ]</script></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"743\">7.4.3 关节力矩分配</h3>\n<p>LQR输出的水平力 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F</script></span> 需要转化为轮端驱动力矩 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\tau_w = F \\cdot r</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\tau_w = F \\cdot r</script></span>。同时，为了抑制身体俯仰，可以通过髋关节施加额外力矩：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\">\n<div class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\n\\tau_{hip} = K_{hp} \\theta + K_{hd} \\dot{\\theta}\n</div>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\tau_{hip} = K_{hp} \\theta + K_{hd} \\dot{\\theta}\n</script>\n</div>\n<p>最终轮端力矩和关节力矩共同作用，实现平衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"75\">7.5 越障、爬坡与楼梯通过控制</h2>\n<h3 id=\"751\">7.5.1 越障流程</h3>\n<p>以跨过高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">H_{obs} = 60</span><script type=\"math/tex\">H_{obs} = 60</script></span> mm 的台阶为例，控制流程如下：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>检测与接近</strong>：深度相机/超声波检测到台阶，机器人减速至0.3 m/s，切换至腿式模式。</li>\n<li><strong>抬腿</strong>：左腿膝关节弯曲，轮子离地高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">&gt; H_{obs} + 20</span><script type=\"math/tex\">> H_{obs} + 20</script></span> mm。</li>\n<li><strong>前伸</strong>：髋关节前摆，左腿轮子越过台阶上方。</li>\n<li><strong>落地</strong>：左腿伸展，轮子接触台阶上表面。</li>\n<li><strong>身体上移</strong>：左腿支撑，右腿轮子保持地面，膝关节伸展推高身体，重心前移。</li>\n<li><strong>右腿越障</strong>：右腿执行同样动作。</li>\n<li><strong>恢复</strong>：双腿轮子均在台阶上，切换回轮式模式继续行驶。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"752\">7.5.2 爬坡控制</h3>\n<p>在坡面（坡度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\alpha \\le 15^\\circ</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\alpha \\le 15^\\circ</script></span>）行驶时，轮式模式可直接应对，但需调整身体姿态保持水平。坡面检测通过IMU俯仰角反馈。控制策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将IMU测量的身体俯仰角与期望俯仰角（<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">0^\\circ</span><script type=\"math/tex\">0^\\circ</script></span>）的误差输入平衡控制器。</li>\n<li>增加轮端输出力矩以克服重力沿坡面的分量：<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">F_{slope} = M g \\sin\\alpha</span><script type=\"math/tex\">F_{slope} = M g \\sin\\alpha</script></span>。</li>\n<li>必要时启动腿式模式，通过关节调整保持轮子充分接地。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"753\">7.5.3 楼梯通过</h3>\n<p>楼梯攀爬采用准静态步态，每次抬升一级台阶。台阶高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">h_{step} = 150</span><script type=\"math/tex\">h_{step} = 150</script></span> mm 时，需充分发挥髋、膝关节运动范围。步态周期约2 s，抬腿高度 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">&gt; h_{step} + 30</span><script type=\"math/tex\">> h_{step} + 30</script></span> mm。身体重心通过调整另一条支撑腿的膝关节保持稳定。楼梯攀爬对地面摩擦和关节力矩要求较高，建议仅在必要时使用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"76\">7.6 控制算法代码实现与调参</h2>\n<h3 id=\"761\">7.6.1 主控制循环</h3>\n<p>底层1 kHz控制中断中按顺序执行：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">TIM6_DAC_IRQHandler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">HAL_TIM_IRQHandler</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">htim6</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 1. 传感器读取</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">imu_read</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gyro</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">read_joint_encoders</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">read_wheel_encoders</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 2. 姿态估计（互补滤波）</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">attitude_update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gyro</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">attitude</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 3. 根据模式执行控制</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">switch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">mode</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">MODE_WHEEL</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">wheel_speed_control</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">balance_control</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"c1\">// LQR输出叠加到轮端</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">break</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">MODE_LEG</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">leg_gait_cycle</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">joint_position_control</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">break</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">case</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"no\">MODE_STANDBY</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"c1\">// 关节力矩置零或保持</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"k\">break</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 4. 发送状态帧</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">send_status_frame</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 5. 喂狗</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">HAL_IWDG_Refresh</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">hiwdg</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"762\">7.6.2 姿态估计（互补滤波）</h3>\n<div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">attitude_update</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">gyro</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">attitude_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">att</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dt</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.001f</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 加速度计计算俯仰角</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acc_pitch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">atan2f</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">],</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sqrtf</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"n\">accel</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">]));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 陀螺仪积分</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">att</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">pitch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">gyro</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dt</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">// 绕Y轴角速度</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// 互补滤波</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">float</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0.98f</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">att</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">pitch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">att</span><span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"n\">pitch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">alpha</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">acc_pitch</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"763\">7.6.3 调参方法</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">参数</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">初始值</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">调参方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">轮速PI</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p=0.8, K_i=0.05</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p=0.8, K_i=0.05</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">增大<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span>响应快但可能振荡，<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_i</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_i</script></span>消除静差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">LQR增益</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">按模型计算</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">保持稳定裕度，可手动微调<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K[2]</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K[2]</script></span>增大抗扰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">互补滤波系数</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">\\alpha=0.98</span><script type=\"math/tex\">\\alpha=0.98</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">越大越信任陀螺仪，越小越信任加速度计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">关节位置PI</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\"><span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p=3.0, K_i=0.1</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p=3.0, K_i=0.1</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">增大<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span>提高跟踪精度，过大引起抖动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">阻抗刚度<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">5 N·m/rad</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">平坦路面增大，颠簸路面减小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>调参步骤：先调电流环（50 μs），再调速度环（1 ms），最后调平衡环（1 ms）。在悬空状态下调试，再落地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"77\">7.7 实战：多模式切换测试与参数整定</h2>\n<h3 id=\"771\">7.7.1 任务目标</h3>\n<p>在实物平台上实现轮式模式、腿式模式及模式切换，验证越障和平衡控制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"772\">7.7.2 测试步骤</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>安全准备</strong>：机器人置于测试场地，周围设置软垫，急停开关就绪。</li>\n<li><strong>轮式模式测试</strong>：上电使能，发送前进/转向指令，观察速度跟踪和转向平滑性。</li>\n<li><strong>平衡测试</strong>：在静止状态轻微推动机器人，观察是否快速恢复站立。</li>\n<li><strong>腿式模式测试</strong>：发送越障指令，观察步态执行和足端轨迹。</li>\n<li><strong>越障测试</strong>：放置60 mm台阶，执行越障流程，记录成功率和时间。</li>\n<li><strong>模式切换测试</strong>：在行驶中触发模式切换，检查切换过程和稳定性。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"773\">7.7.3 常见问题与排查</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">问题</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">可能原因</th>\n<th style=\"text-align: left;\">排查方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">轮式模式速度振荡</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">速度环<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span>过大、编码器噪声</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">减小<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"MathJax_Preview\">K_p</span><script type=\"math/tex\">K_p</script></span>，滤波编码器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">平衡失效，向后倒</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">LQR增益不当、质心估计错误</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">重新标定质心，调整增益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">腿式步态抬腿高度不够</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">逆运动学解算错误、关节限位</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">检查关节角范围，调整轨迹参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">模式切换时摔倒</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">切换条件不满足、执行过快</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">降低切换速度，增加过渡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">越障时轮子打滑</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">地面摩擦不足、力矩过大</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: left;\">降低轮端力矩，增加轮胎花纹</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>完成本章实战后，读者应能掌握轮腿复合运动控制的核心算法和调试方法，为后续章节的导航与任务系统奠定运动基础。</p>","headings":[{"level":2,"id":"71","text":"7.1 轮式模式速度与转向控制"},{"level":3,"id":"711","text":"7.1.1 差速驱动模型"},{"level":3,"id":"712","text":"7.1.2 轮速控制"},{"level":3,"id":"713","text":"7.1.3 转向控制"},{"level":2,"id":"72","text":"7.2 腿式步态规划与足端轨迹"},{"level":3,"id":"721","text":"7.2.1 步态序列设计"},{"level":3,"id":"722","text":"7.2.2 足端轨迹规划"},{"level":3,"id":"723","text":"7.2.3 步态规划代码实现"},{"level":2,"id":"73","text":"7.3 轮腿协同控制策略"},{"level":3,"id":"731","text":"7.3.1 模式切换状态机"},{"level":3,"id":"732","text":"7.3.2 协同控制"},{"level":2,"id":"74","text":"7.4 姿态控制与平衡"},{"level":3,"id":"741","text":"7.4.1 简化倒立摆模型"},{"level":3,"id":"742-lqr","text":"7.4.2 LQR平衡控制器"},{"level":3,"id":"743","text":"7.4.3 关节力矩分配"},{"level":2,"id":"75","text":"7.5 越障、爬坡与楼梯通过控制"},{"level":3,"id":"751","text":"7.5.1 越障流程"},{"level":3,"id":"752","text":"7.5.2 爬坡控制"},{"level":3,"id":"753","text":"7.5.3 楼梯通过"},{"level":2,"id":"76","text":"7.6 控制算法代码实现与调参"},{"level":3,"id":"761","text":"7.6.1 主控制循环"},{"level":3,"id":"762","text":"7.6.2 姿态估计（互补滤波）"},{"level":3,"id":"763","text":"7.6.3 调参方法"},{"level":2,"id":"77","text":"7.7 实战：多模式切换测试与参数整定"},{"level":3,"id":"771","text":"7.7.1 任务目标"},{"level":3,"id":"772","text":"7.7.2 测试步骤"},{"level":3,"id":"773","text":"7.7.3 常见问题与排查"}]}